    "ratchet": {
      "weeks": 4,
      "_doc": "docs/agents.md 6.2: a KPI that meets its target 4 ISO weeks in a row gets next week's target = best weekly value of those weeks moved by step in the better direction (step_kind pct: x(1 +/- step), abs: +/- step), clamped to cap; targets only ever tighten (the configured target is the floor); risk KPIs (risk.*, company.dd_month_pct) only tighten or hold; no step = hold."
    }
